WEBVTT

00:05:56.394 --> 00:06:00.856
and information is everything,
like questions, but also data,

00:06:00.898 --> 00:06:04.151
context, emerging insights,
work in progress,

00:06:04.193 --> 00:06:06.487
even water cooler conversations.

00:06:07.238 --> 00:06:10.491
Sharing means less
one-on-one communication,

00:06:10.533 --> 00:06:15.454
much more crowdsourcing and co-creation
in the open, transparent space,

00:06:15.496 --> 00:06:16.872
real time.

00:06:17.456 --> 00:06:20.668
And with more upheaval
than you might naturally think of.

00:06:21.794 --> 00:06:22.962
Wait.

00:06:23.003 --> 00:06:25.631
Doesn't that get really
messy, even chaotic?

00:06:27.049 --> 00:06:29.802
Well, we are used to information
overload already.